[{"sha":"d25969b1b6dbbc3cded59d6d8589f1600ee1b671","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGQyNTk2OWIxYjZkYmJjM2NkZWQ1OWQ2ZDg1ODlmMTYwMGVlMWI2NzE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nick Hollon","email":"nick.hollon@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-25T17:40:53Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-25T17:40:53Z"},"message":"ci(evals): run evals tests when eval workflow files change (#4260)\n\nAdd the five eval-package workflow files to the `evals` path filter in\n`ci.yml` so editing any of them runs the evals test job:\n\n```\nevals:\n  - 'libs/evals/**'\n  - '.github/workflows/evals.yml'      # ← added\n  - '.github/workflows/harbor.yml'     # ← added\n  - '.github/workflows/clbench.yml'    # ← added\n  - '.github/workflows/evals_trials.yml' # ← added\n  - '.github/workflows/_eval.yml'      # ← added\n  - '.github/workflows/ci.yml'\n  - '.github/workflows/_lint.yml'\n  - '.github/workflows/_test.yml'\n  - '.github/actions/**'\n```\n\n## Why\n\nThe evals test suite asserts on its **own workflow YAML** —\n`test_harbor_langsmith_integration.py` reads `harbor.yml` and\n`_eval.yml` and checks their contents. But the `evals` filter only\nwatched `libs/evals/**` plus shared infra workflows, so a change to\n`harbor.yml` (etc.) did **not** trigger the evals job.\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"5aa5dfc7e85b339da53c94136a9bc5105a4111dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5aa5dfc7e85b339da53c94136a9bc5105a4111dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/d25969b1b6dbbc3cded59d6d8589f1600ee1b671","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPWglCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAs7MQAJVIWKCU2KTiLw7POK/x4zIg\n8W3MZZifpmf0WFoHI33kYDM0+wIpcYrCKe3ZzR9cPkmShMN5xECjhD9JifbOGuYR\n1vqM3tHMAGaL7Ggv/eJYiiJDOrSJWGSAjk1IsNBo3UADQi4XWYPyz5h/Jvg5x0Yh\nAYRpJvuT8BPPcXtAx6bI0Vv9LeICdy4IxRyL2PHWMPdMKHSQwMRZ0sROClpyuMpV\nLXgegZH2O9NQPf8VxTXiC2H/Zb/uxwJauexjyy6M3zVJYJ0YhqXn2uA9vCkXDL7m\neclW0RZSUqAm/0mJfmas4Pq++ZUOdNcpoJE5KTM3WBVciHw+y6pbmZeuYThLRKM5\nlQq/3bwMDeLi3XKXTLZky96klfmkndyJspvg2KdFAOJQbZqG6/26wqCm8nOexjh3\nNoLRTqwEFXI/T6DM1J6CzRCSUCd3gpPoaSm3WiDGYhB7JY/zKW8ASMfuz+jKbnlr\nvml7ii950hR+kkX1vA3lQ5CHMzEe8ahZFwWcsBh4jwB4oURmsejwqBGY8DUL+TRB\nX9YL212s0ggCRBkrCmJx1TqiuvxlYFFaTRO0UwTFQj/ZxFNkrPbg+ZegLYOHJTGu\nDth+oqpiJ2Xhpi4o18f5Is6nkP0jmtYBjIgQUoda6JkjF/Hp2+ZoYcOCWopjo9Uu\nvwIsYR85n8s0SOeAlzYo\n=QnDS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5aa5dfc7e85b339da53c94136a9bc5105a4111dd\nparent 6370435167d27ab66d185eadb079ae1d9dc1b0e0\nauthor Nick Hollon <nick.hollon@langchain.dev> 1782409253 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782409253 -0400\n\nci(evals): run evals tests when eval workflow files change (#4260)\n\nAdd the five eval-package workflow files to the `evals` path filter in\n`ci.yml` so editing any of them runs the evals test job:\n\n```\nevals:\n  - 'libs/evals/**'\n  - '.github/workflows/evals.yml'      # ← added\n  - '.github/workflows/harbor.yml'     # ← added\n  - '.github/workflows/clbench.yml'    # ← added\n  - '.github/workflows/evals_trials.yml' # ← added\n  - '.github/workflows/_eval.yml'      # ← added\n  - '.github/workflows/ci.yml'\n  - '.github/workflows/_lint.yml'\n  - '.github/workflows/_test.yml'\n  - '.github/actions/**'\n```\n\n## Why\n\nThe evals test suite asserts on its **own workflow YAML** —\n`test_harbor_langsmith_integration.py` reads `harbor.yml` and\n`_eval.yml` and checks their contents. But the `evals` filter only\nwatched `libs/evals/**` plus shared infra workflows, so a change to\n`harbor.yml` (etc.) did **not** trigger the evals job.\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","verified_at":"2026-06-25T17:41:31Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d25969b1b6dbbc3cded59d6d8589f1600ee1b671","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d25969b1b6dbbc3cded59d6d8589f1600ee1b671","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d25969b1b6dbbc3cded59d6d8589f1600ee1b671/comments","author":{"login":"nick-hollon-lc","id":274035459,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFVzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274035459?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc","html_url":"https://github.com/nick-hollon-lc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"6370435167d27ab66d185eadb079ae1d9dc1b0e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6370435167d27ab66d185eadb079ae1d9dc1b0e0","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6370435167d27ab66d185eadb079ae1d9dc1b0e0"}]},{"sha":"6370435167d27ab66d185eadb079ae1d9dc1b0e0","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDYzNzA0MzUxNjdkMjdhYjY2ZDE4NWVhZGIwNzlhZTFkOWRjMWIwZTA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-25T17:31:36Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-25T17:31:36Z"},"message":"docs(repo): document version-branch sync PR title (#4261)\n\nDocuments the CI-safe title to use for version-branch sync PRs and\nexplains why `release` should not be used as the scope.\n\nThis covers the general PR title guidance and the release runbook's\nstaging flow so future `main` -> `vX.Y` sync PRs pass title lint.","tree":{"sha":"976312722e5b3720e541d190839d272df20dc542","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/976312722e5b3720e541d190839d272df20dc542"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/6370435167d27ab66d185eadb079ae1d9dc1b0e0","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPWX4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbdgQADniSQD2q2DlpijMG4WbWQ5j\nsGp0E9bxeZT/I5iGbX4Xtx3iOP4+ztRcd80SrF9nyoEqwgjCEECnu1DaFcdpG6AP\n0H7hka1cZNGaNmUuPa9BBfKw6eu8Grr+dtUy8wvqvV3CkllJWstn6oFGP7oquxr1\n2vQxV8+C90dsJ2oS1DG++213XzZPraAd69XCXRnkyZNmbzDat4fAVUiQycjNsbJp\n73az4FoIb4dDXLT8Ufzp3uGTxGcLAaBJ2VJxbzqSg5RVQDCgbZ1vv9j9C6cPiwRZ\nuxJGhdJdskf0L0msWwOKLwdRiHj+OgMKbBY+2xxuLDS5mcWG6wKEE7evGlsZZXy4\ngnJHUt0V4QEgkBT7HEUgan0BC5DNQNJwlJI2E62dFPox3Kima5sd379s1u1NsIrv\nTqf+Pqw9J7iV6ITr+r0B3hiCHxAjdIaPL+dGaWkzTt8x9evgl/shmYHOVQo3LOLH\nqiZXSvqR+t4nAPmUBoM5jsEPEC587v4