_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"5156471b5a0784ba19f9b0c2c086a8e8d22ff8ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5156471b5a0784ba19f9b0c2c086a8e8d22ff8ce","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/5156471b5a0784ba19f9b0c2c086a8e8d22ff8ce"}]},{"sha":"5156471b5a0784ba19f9b0c2c086a8e8d22ff8ce","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDUxNTY0NzFiNWEwNzg0YmExOWY5YjBjMmMwODZhOGU4ZDIyZmY4Y2U","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-25T09:36:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-25T09:36:50Z"},"message":"release(langchain-quickjs): 0.3.2 (#4156)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.3.2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/langchain-quickjs==0.3.1...langchain-quickjs==0.3.2)\n(2026-06-25)\n\n### Features\n\n* Dynamic subagents UI\n([#4221](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4221))\n([10bcba2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/10bcba25600e51aba135f170b34aa6315c0f53d6))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Ensure top-level title on subagent response schemas\n([#4155](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4155))\n([08f917e](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/08f917eea79513e7e894731f884e738c2d30383f))\n* Normalize nested `undefined` tool args\n([#3935](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3935))\n([1b461a0](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1b461a0d6c6a7a6d323db18505596fcce4326b92))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec69eab354ca9ffdc2a58bca87ec7026711a4d12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/ec69eab354ca9ffdc2a58bca87ec7026711a4d12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/5156471b5a0784ba19f9b0c2c086a8e8d22ff8ce","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPPayCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAztMQAIO9EVNheeAhpcMBZRf5KITA\nxNv84Pd8muvQiX/jGtsF/Kro8WuWjWAD/wOHfw14fNkHXItaRwcytcYssfPlG8kS\niPbgFFZc+BLbiIn+O+gR841gTisSe29ggBdcFkWYNyH9D3DIHz+Bfocvq+W+7q/M\nGgWLyFNbm0f9brxS6rG6p11JMJl4K4WpTnobdxH+SrC1K3B5CqCndXF3NvPsY+hP\nd92rtSuXcc3Ydok/+nALi+xi6nBkuVsz0cp128rql9fpCTB3evk8wGEmBxHCSMPB\nhGEXBPdMpvJHZZySgxuRp3v88hlhPqnu/EfZa18ofguuHhfZDUD/19o7f+Y6wl9b\n0e/ZHmxoOijvn9XbNUTUyYntJjEJ5OQ4eN70tRBmg6j+uL8PcJN08dFYK8rraPEN\nuYlssUkfssqAaqoHNemPOT+e53jNx/4ZRXWvbKDZOhD0ycHIqg2iT8t/dLNmJK7Y\nqDcYtHLGNS6N4uzJNjwsHgdHl6t1w7IFq7QtuLVwa7Jw1wFHTTIGqW+c/cLKuaby\nKQ4cRGJw8RiGxPCIg/65boqaHQahkAvb3UQWBz/Y5xIRW5PRgGAQ8HpMailqwMfj\n6kaZ7xlqBjGf8MpuQLe3v+YoQjbyIiCa75EbeTl91M5AX85VlQtC0+KJBpbb4Rn2\nL/ofO314LcYd6IV/6A8e\n=Nt4P\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ec69eab354ca9ffdc2a58bca87ec7026711a4d12\nparent bbed7268603706da42d8ba5d5b3595ed540edf6e\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1782380210 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782380210 -0400\n\nrelease(langchain-quickjs): 0.3.2 (#4156)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.3.2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/langchain-quickjs==0.3.1...langchain-quickjs==0.3.2)\n(2026-06-25)\n\n### Features\n\n* Dynamic subagents UI\n([#4221](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4221))\n([10bcba2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/10bcba25600e51aba135f170b34aa6315c0f53d6))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Ensure top-level title on subagent response schemas\n([#4155](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4155))\n([08f917e](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/08f917eea79513e7e894731f884e738c2d30383f))\n* Normalize nested `undefined` tool args\n([#3935](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3935))\n([1b461a0](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1b461a0d6c6a7a6d323db18505596fcce4326b92))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-25T09:36:51Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5156471b5a0784ba19f9b0c2c086a8e8d22ff8ce","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/5156471b5a0784ba19f9b0c2c086a8e8d22ff8ce","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5156471b5a0784ba19f9b0c2c086a8e8d22ff8ce/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"bbed7268603706da42d8ba5d5b3595ed540edf6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bbed7268603706da42d8ba5d5b3595ed540edf6e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/bbed7268603706da42d8ba5d5b3595ed540edf6e"}]},{"sha":"bbed7268603706da42d8ba5d5b3595ed540edf6e","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGJiZWQ3MjY4NjAzNzA2ZGE0MmQ4YmE1ZDViMzU5NWVkNTQwZWRmNmU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-25T09:25:48Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-25T09:25:48Z"},"message":"hotfix(code): allow prereleases for pinned alpha updates (#4247)\n\nStable `deepagents-code` releases can intentionally depend on prerelease\npackage versions, such as an alpha SDK pin during coordinated release\nwork. Previously, the updater discovered the stable app release but\ninvoked `uv` in stable-only mode, so `uv` resolved back to the old app\nversion while `dcode update` still reported success.\n\nThis teaches the update flow to inspect the target release metadata for\nprerelease dependency specifiers and opt `uv` into prerelease resolution\nonly when the target needs it. The behavior is wired through CLI\nupdates, startup auto-update, in-app `/update`, and notification-driven\ninstalls, so manual and automatic paths use the same resolver mode.\n\nUsers on older versions can recover manually with:\n\n```bash\nuv tool install --reinstall -U 'deepagents-code[anthropic,baseten,google-genai,openai]' --prerelease allow\n```","tree":{"sha":"7b26fa257415317e18a1cff1731ba4cc54000191","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/7b26fa257415317e18a1cff1731ba4cc54000191"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/bbed7268603706da42d8ba5d5b3595ed540edf6e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPPQcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALQYQAKXBUSx4RtSXtwKIvZNV6UgB\ngw/CMJvxxa+cmXYhE+yTEBP9SUf4tle7jY9bpi709Swh0zCeiQ0WlM6v4lg7m7jz\nRVRDJPL6WqH2B4HOeJghRdWcfv6B4gxfWC3HX9a7/W0xmTSaKw8oHxCIsLNw/Dov\nSGahv1ZXuMRaZgNkPcSK3t4qN4UuatQrTrFi21+IW9b5zS3mQxf+x5XfW6DJzGAX\ngR/7H7Vlr54jLQhCLTVWv8m1x9dREcog1MFoJyqqjp3+cbpSVWI4XGm2qm+RagiK\nF+6F2VRRY3siZR14C/CBKRJ8Lj3P3vSVxH9fpdXZs87e9m5CU/Y0eVkPxfas5CCR\nA8r5iokS3JFYjZXjnHLe+HFFXAi3JwmnZ4vPMFOmYh2ab/lALfU+u7TpUeNvYSct\nRBjdhOg/94P57NDShM7LDugh81eo4+2vDnczc2EkoLPr7DRmwQ9qXItCgkqn5gsk\nrAumDFH6Ov8/QwZezlc+xr6+vr5m1kd9cZdNYb7bFB0hpsGnKLhNoQjH37oeXwW4\nAtObJnnhy5100XdUcotXoQWXV24aqynWjUdErmwxYlVSSKEl6DlJ7gPibx6z47+M\nKg7LCVVYS3x3jpgzUOjf+vhgP9nwxqike0mitkGZlVppz9zBrgtxJeoFfiilXru7\nEZUupDxbUfOPrYUqlSpJ\n=4y0Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 7b26fa257415317e18a1cff1731ba4cc54000191\nparent a918a2eebddfe13ef84fe0d1f9fa74e4d81cec73\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1782379548 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782379548 -0400\n\nhotfix(code): allow prereleases for pinned alpha updates (#4247)\n\nStable `deepagents-code` releases can intentionally depend on prerelease\npackage versions, such as an alpha SDK pin during coordinated release\nwork. Previously, the updater discovered the stable app release but\ninvoked `uv` in stable-only mode, so `uv` resolved back to the old app\nversion while `dcode update` still reported success.\n\nThis teaches the update flow to inspect the target release metadata for\nprerelease dependency specifiers and opt `uv` into prerelease resolution\nonly when the target needs it. The behavior is wired through CLI\nupdates, startup auto-update, in-app `/update`, and notification-driven\ninstalls, so manual and automatic paths use the same resolver mode.\n\nUsers on older versions can recover manually with:\n\n```bash\nuv tool install --reinstall -U 'deepagents-code[anthropic,baseten,google-genai,openai]' --prerelease allow\n```","verified_at":"2026-06-25T09:25:48Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bbed7268603706da42d8ba5d5b3595ed540edf6e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/bbed7268603706da42d8ba5d5b3595ed540edf6e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bbed7268603706da42d8ba5d5b3595ed540edf6e/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/