ts-code): 0.1.24 (#4241)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.24](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.23...deepagents-code==0.1.24)\n(2026-06-25)\n\n### Features\n\n* Enable `js_eval` by default\n([#4245](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4245))\n([2e04ff3](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2e04ff397e60389c9a19c4a9b528e15602ad8338))\n* Dynamic subagents UI\n([#4221](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4221))\n([10bcba2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/10bcba25600e51aba135f170b34aa6315c0f53d6))\n* Gate onboarding integrations modal behind opt-in flag\n([#4227](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4227))\n([6c930c5](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6c930c5e4502f572be554acc896c5fb6d061e0e5))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Eager managed ripgrep install via `dcode tools install`\n([#4199](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4199))\n([cf536f3](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/cf536f339958d6726fa41f896c4a3e42df644c9f))\n* Interrupt remote runs on chat cancellation\n([#4234](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4234))\n([37c5fa2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/37c5fa23e621616836694bc59c1b0c38def81604))\n* Sync approval toggles during active runs\n([#4239](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4239))\n([4600365](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4600365ea0b60c3e9113ecf59b5336be37d03428))\n* Clear stale live approval mode keys\n([#4242](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4242))\n([f11a769](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f11a76962c9d536a38e27ac05b32feca364b2424))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c8678b5102d0be52f1e0de89eda9db46fca06a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5c8678b5102d0be52f1e0de89eda9db46fca06a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/7810a35f2a51d5d83c9e1291dfc094ce4faa0cc7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPOh0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASxYQAIZWnkleW7kUiMgkaymntDgU\n70lJCHHuxANOjBi7+btoN+SPyE8lhMxlX1xL4p+FB+toLLaC6htjZ2uFyPItdh/F\n1agdCgnEDODsm4J9Tud99ZrHgYrxA/29OAE9PG3h6u8Wz8VblVSmb065FzQcEiUr\ngBoFvQzZrkNmGWshgDclDlr/0RWWz+onfKPMx1ePrKx0PYH0J7olVbFpIZZrYISF\nsHHe194Bw16PifaJNVdlKcU2c3dTs1hOzE1CW5/fy8pvMo5NJ+38dKUtP/UxkETG\nvxSU5Ch50hQH2SmFbwF5/KPRdzY3/Pazg6VbcEyewTzIt3qA40/cxzGJARsALBar\nUs4qg1C9kRixyt1uz1htf/m3MrH8GSYGwevyQhdopTKd1PHv4jgXtNdV9oloofhC\ndIghXXUMAU8F6VywCA7O//erKCD0ZRTF/9Wo7htaF17ARjOg7BRPr30BrPpTqGu9\n8qhX4BgnWi/f/YqcarLmfPCVQeMGexU3fKyUmLbiVyeehhCdwUnoQS2QPghfQidI\nVF6Prx/PZMs9qPXqnGSUi2aNpXqzQrc1xu+0uv5dYvLonw5bYg2jONZYLdkyNsNL\nolMGP9CiG3BOABuWN6R4fI/6YGNFMpZqIBzv93t9RnwHjXxtMtGkxiSqG0RlnVWA\n2v0cTxcAVD8zvEVZR+eQ\n=VHMm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5c8678b5102d0be52f1e0de89eda9db46fca06a1\nparent 2e04ff397e60389c9a19c4a9b528e15602ad8338\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1782376564 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782376564 -0400\n\nrelease(deepagents-code): 0.1.24 (#4241)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.24](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.23...deepagents-code==0.1.24)\n(2026-06-25)\n\n### Features\n\n* Enable `js_eval` by default\n([#4245](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4245))\n([2e04ff3](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2e04ff397e60389c9a19c4a9b528e15602ad8338))\n* Dynamic subagents UI\n([#4221](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4221))\n([10bcba2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/10bcba25600e51aba135f170b34aa6315c0f53d6))\n* Gate onboarding integrations modal behind opt-in flag\n([#4227](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4227))\n([6c930c5](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6c930c5e4502f572be554acc896c5fb6d061e0e5))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Eager managed ripgrep install via `dcode tools install`\n([#4199](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4199))\n([cf536f3](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/cf536f339958d6726fa41f896c4a3e42df644c9f))\n* Interrupt remote runs on chat cancellation\n([#4234](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4234))\n([37c5fa2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/37c5fa23e621616836694bc59c1b0c38def81604))\n* Sync approval toggles during active runs\n([#4239](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4239))\n([4600365](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4600365ea0b60c3e9113ecf59b5336be37d03428))\n* Clear stale live approval mode keys\n([#4242](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4242))\n([f11a769](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f11a76962c9d536a38e27ac05b32feca364b2424))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-25T08:36:05Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7810a35f2a51d5d83c9e1291dfc094ce4faa0cc7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7810a35f2a51d5d83c9e1291dfc094ce4faa0cc7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7810a35f2a51d5d83c9e1291dfc094ce4faa0cc7/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"logi