":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-24T19:22:32Z"},"message":"fix(ci): bypass release PR scope check for release artifacts (#4222)\n\nRelease-please PRs can touch generated/version artifacts across multiple\npackage directories, which does not fit the normal “title scope covers\ntouched package dirs” rule. The scope/file gate now stands down only for\nrelease-shaped PRs whose entire changeset is limited to known\nrelease-please artifacts, so ordinary source edits still trigger the\nmismatch check.","tree":{"sha":"5943726881bb184951307fb015e344316132535d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5943726881bb184951307fb015e344316132535d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/3f2d76705ca04959ce9bcf58f980ba9d96915db5","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPC54CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkfIQAHpM2LKr3F3akANlxKM+wV+o\nvjrocJVy9Ac716TljKl1yu1mhcDb/KF1et+CmDVudrp1je561KlOBp6zrRNu+rxp\noswBpigGO6ziXOSBMyKMLDfWPRdUO2HI+ez/oj4E8Ar4bhXPeJXVWbOobWmv8FbO\n81BBV+cqdJSIt2tt1gZj4oH9q3C7tRzcpPhpvsOS0pii1bDkc7ms6ln/OK4U1gRd\n4hR0E8ID7eqomEwTr41kHfIcOmVdTSl+zrd16kvIszoAbAfQErw+cJzmIiVF32SX\nDlrGe7WzIZOV9zGBhnhnlTQT3hUX5F3FMDsPDlOgTIdChrohoXPHaBFnqgIc4pxW\nPF8XyiNUP4WSMpfSqRAc0slIkqv2Y0h8GzLQA8hhJeknSRkijbeG2pp4NhZM5kPA\nx4MnrUdy3hkjoAVPmHTZ6BGHJ/ovf0AyKAgk6R0ZjUiBKAPo0abBe52VFQYJVd/Z\nV8jV8FyFtHtNNoV7VAA2oOAP4j2rLgsukM6RI47Ji7hWgwYTrxnMhRmtB1R96B3A\nmZhSc6pX1HboYmgx7J4+0x87hsF5xrzB9a9YxokJQNk2eqo1DARhozmdAVt9poKK\nEsF/+IdmnkpHJO+0ZXA1qHu5uuICVnetiDuJ4FPsGnJjylz34vOGq3mYc6G24ps7\nO6GMGbnogDnw8r8lGvjF\n=dn+n\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5943726881bb184951307fb015e344316132535d\nparent 0ea679ed10c5dd3293ad348713d4ddf30d3a1bdb\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1782328952 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782328952 -0400\n\nfix(ci): bypass release PR scope check for release artifacts (#4222)\n\nRelease-please PRs can touch generated/version artifacts across multiple\npackage directories, which does not fit the normal “title scope covers\ntouched package dirs” rule. The scope/file gate now stands down only for\nrelease-shaped PRs whose entire changeset is limited to known\nrelease-please artifacts, so ordinary source edits still trigger the\nmismatch check.","verified_at":"2026-06-24T19:22:33Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3f2d76705ca04959ce9bcf58f980ba9d96915db5","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3f2d76705ca04959ce9bcf58f980ba9d96915db5","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3f2d76705ca04959ce9bcf58f980ba9d96915db5/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following