events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ebf3dc3f0a24fd3cf3ab11a494399f06efc18f85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ebf3dc3f0a24fd3cf3ab11a494399f06efc18f85","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ebf3dc3f0a24fd3cf3ab11a494399f06efc18f85"}]},{"sha":"ebf3dc3f0a24fd3cf3ab11a494399f06efc18f85","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGViZjNkYzNmMGEyNGZkM2NmM2FiMTFhNDk0Mzk5ZjA2ZWZjMThmODU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-23T22:46:23Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-23T22:46:23Z"},"message":"docs(code): clarify onboarding integrations copy (#4181)\n\nThe onboarding \"Installed Integrations\" screen described optional\npackages in a way that was confusing to new or non-technical users. This\nrewords the copy to plainly explain that model providers and sandboxes\ncome from optional add-on packages, the installed ones are ready to use\nnow, and the rest can be added with `/install`.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/903002d2-207e-17b7-f276-79c35f68641e)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5979fa40b13b71b6fd52991cb574f5409bc749fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5979fa40b13b71b6fd52991cb574f5409bc749fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/ebf3dc3f0a24fd3cf3ab11a494399f06efc18f85","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOwy/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjwIQAH1MJ5AkhM+kyGO5XA+LBPpE\nG6lOacaUtlKUweG9CeyPHu14VzIseFd//JCDnQUU73OHLVGifpqPh/2zwMVues+t\naQCKd8ecj9NvAhHzwe77GAuhh55apofFhISAIEY1G/dj/pLL21PhbEZoDljsDPEW\nfSrxK/5BPmZ2X4QpYr55MEWbH8AIwu6iiTRbXDSTPbIkHa3jsXqD0iguBEcS4ozT\nXPuG8F99ZSQg57D3veGZyMEwjjvrvOE/M9SrSRMfCP9JFTC0PGu9RN86MBFJOpln\nXSDGSJJXBgiIyOm4JAF1Goyez7UHtTaO+UkxUGSOe88MTMQzygwy0h0826zaI4oT\n7PED780ZWjvkCBjgd7ohMEQkwVeIzmmT4+4mHX4rp+efguY/b8XSQPYiHj2Sgdj/\nM3uIrmidpmfEeWcJHU2n0HqZC+oUClA2Q8wQsnGwftjcWrB8I9wjbgkKE3vnEdHY\nQc149QHKwRR2QzkFfHlx3H8IBuNMDikqxcbppQU3XF4TX6gUq5Q3qFnlEeNPIsfk\nEuKoGOBemkbbzU+9svi151vCn0eoJEIZoSyyBcrU2rqzPT/CNptbIi8KHKKQzvrO\nGZBAB6gQbm853uDUHkV8/tB+BxIQAAlWujGugQm1DakIr6w3W468vbfvOXBM2Yd5\nq1NOO0SBpXuL+N4D2zPl\n=K4as\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5979fa40b13b71b6fd52991cb574f5409bc749fb\nparent d869d1e1fa8558510fb48e71f78fb74c69ca4840\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1782254783 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782254783 -0400\n\ndocs(code): clarify onboarding integrations copy (#4181)\n\nThe onboarding \"Installed Integrations\" screen described optional\npackages in a way that was confusing to new or non-technical users. This\nrewords the copy to plainly explain that model providers and sandboxes\ncome from optional add-on packages, the installed ones are ready to use\nnow, and the rest can be added with `/install`.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/903002d2-207e-17b7-f276-79c35f68641e)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-23T22:46:24Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ebf3dc3f0a24fd3cf3ab11a494399f06efc18f85","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ebf3dc3f0a24fd3cf3ab11a494399f06efc18f85","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ebf3dc3f0a24fd3cf3ab11a494399f06efc18f85/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"d869d1e1fa8558510fb48e71f78fb74c69ca4840","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d869d1e1fa8558510fb48e71f78fb74c69ca4840","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d869d1e1fa8558510fb48e71f78fb74c69ca4840"}]},{"sha":"d869d1e1fa8558510fb48e71f78fb74c69ca4840","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGQ4NjlkMWUxZmE4NTU4NTEwZmI0OGU3MWY3OGZiNzRjNjljYTQ4NDA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-23T22:31:40Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-23T22:31:40Z"},"message":"fix(code): exclude managed bin dir from agent picker (#4190)\n\nFix the `/agents` picker listing the internal `bin` directory (managed\nripgrep install) as a selectable agent.\n\n---\n\nThe `/agents` picker lists every real, non-dot subdirectory under\n`~/.deepagents/`, filtering only symlinks and dot-prefixed names. The\nmanaged ripgrep install dir (`~/.deepagents/bin`,\n`managed_tools.BIN_DIR`) therefore showed up as a phantom `bin` agent.\nThis adds a reserved-name filter to `_is_agent_dir_entry`, sourced from\n`BIN_DIR.name` to keep a single source of truth.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/3cd7dda7-db49-2afd-b636-d678ecc65dc0)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e87ee8378bbe67a1c502c5b348ed0124f4b073db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/e87ee8378bbe67a1c502c5b348ed0124f4b073db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/d869d1e1fa8558510fb48e71f78fb74c69ca4840","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOwlMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgAwQAJGbaOvMYV9Xi82YLVjaSX7W\nz1dz9RChxzXkLJkIkM/sqHS+zKEuMeOrvgBk6zZ0MEKS2eKWxbiSqKMwryIe7Kid\nTT3a4YUXZqclS/28Gyaz1mTYX+uq6QNjLRoe2jMCJS+7DNqxNvDeAZgwTEDCIVII\n4mZ8wYpyMry8PD6japk0lzjuDYu8X5IqP0ASwZpnagM9lgf9At8T0M6hVgcC79xh\nsgbRV4n3SZb2dVRYHh7Y+9UNPF0t0Yt4pIVtFlZqFGXKNzEnl4IxTTiHjokWtox1\n2GRWzLaHgbCkprbjF7s6UbG9k4V9jg/7lcChbGFsMvFIsMbjgIW8hFoMXMXIUo/X\nIVgJCbLV3/k9rF3JYpng7cHXVa24t9bpTaSZVPxLT14wFTQsSMcRr64E0ZeakQn6\nDjwC9OFYw4KgHFVGLovXF37TrJQQ4DKIR7PbaxxtCVVn6EBhQweMyZHffBpy4+tS\nvs63G+N7rNB1ZN5cJWKno4sgnt/QSm/EaY92wYjeFWEZa1J9Ykv1JRAJ5WkVNpYt\nPkV93UgQvg/JPCJxyjZSOrn8f8IRKSxulgYqltQFgagyqC7Ed6Ez5mUymPddGiAB\nlw0IkJog7bxXAc7q4VDwjEZ/SqmLbOW07+10p6QV8tWnTAIrUwENhWp7ux6qhM7W\n+aDiUy+PLisAmc9vTiFV\n=yjSX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e87ee8378bbe67a1c502c5b348ed0124f4b073db\nparent afbc56a1d9dbe8a89015f4c2f90bb87547d5c1d4\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1782253900 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782253900 -0400\n\nfix(code): exclude managed bin dir from agent picker (#4190)\n\nFix the `/agents` picker listing the internal `bin` directory (managed\nripgrep install) as a selectable agent.\n\n---\n\nThe `/agents` picker lists every real, non-dot subdirectory under\n`~/.deepagents/`, filtering only symlinks and dot-prefixed names. The\nmanaged ripgrep install dir (`~/.deepagents/bin`,\n`managed_tools.BIN_DIR`) therefore showed up as a phantom `bin` agent.\nThis adds a reserved-name filter to `_is_agent_dir_entry`, sourced from\n`BIN_DIR.name` to keep a single source of truth.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/3cd7dda7-db49-2afd-b636-d678ecc65dc0)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-23T22:31:41Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d869d1e1fa8558510fb48e71f78fb74c69ca4840","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d869d1e1fa8558510fb48e71f78fb74c69ca4840","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d869d1e1fa8558510fb48e71f78fb74c69ca4840/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"afbc56a1d9dbe8a89015f4c2f90bb87547d5c1d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/afbc56a1d9dbe8a89015f4c2f90bb87547d5c1d4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/afbc56a1d9dbe8a89015f4c2f90bb87547d5c1d4"}]},{"sha":"afbc56a1d9dbe8a89015f4c2f90bb87547d5c1d4","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGFmYmM1NmExZDlkYmU4YTg5MDE1ZjRjMmY5MGJiODc1NDdkNWMxZDQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-23T22:21:51Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-23T22:21:51Z"},"message":"fix(code): keep auth modal interactive after install-on-select (#4187)\n\nFixed an unresponsive API-key prompt after installing a provider from\nthe `/model` switcher.\n\n---\n\nWhen the `/model` switcher installs a missing provider extra (e.g.\n`baseten`) and then prompts for an API key, the `AuthPromptScreen` was\ncompletely unresponsive — typing, `F2`, and clicks did nothing.\n\nThe router `_handle_model_selection` scheduled\n`_install_extra_then_switch` via `call_later`, which runs the coroutine\ninline on the App message pump. That flow awaits the credential modal\nthrough `_push_screen_wait`, so the pump stayed blocked for the modal's\nentire lifetime and no key/mouse events were ever forwarded to it. The\nfix runs the install-then-switch flow in a Worker (a separate task) so\nthe pump stays free, mirroring the existing thread-selector pattern;\n`call_after_refresh` lets the dismissing selector fully unwind before\nthe worker starts.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/abddcdb2-ea10-237c-747c-cb4a1f85d7f4)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ee08bd5741a275a3b82f422a1e45619e4b3943e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/6ee08bd5741a275a3b82f422a1e45619e4b3943e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/afbc56a1d9dbe8a89015f4c2f90bb87547d5c1d4","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOwb/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2IwQAGTfLPAbh6Sj/kKrc3XU0AIe\norRv0o4+kg9bbmsj0WALYEtbd3e8WFVYTpuD7oQR0bpBNOdt8V4HJ99+U88vvR1T\nrCAq3XWjiD7kjidtp12GNukivzTNkXebuLJpP4oqn0kEASZcV0uEGbyO59NJOhim\nEsYqEkvNvH+gEFevcqSWJBPFH382haq6b59z4VfF7z36GfYAjl/FTNVuLk7YumEm\ngOdpqB1NyzkeidGK1r0HpqJ8LCYRTkEQwMgm874HIeV31xt4AFvhsGe7WOZSZx3h\nj8JaugqKs/ce1ac3v5vcBV7Ajcv9VZIPoM70LqlPcR37pbWLTGV9M6qAfkbXlTZ9\nWCFhQryGFdlgxJ9nrEgKWd0JOPbpwBo7atdhO4kpHvSq9Q/8LMlnjV3qGzUcxEYQ\n5BsFCap6C40JF27X2KTp4r2h5J6TQMIUGq+Cz9FdwPuaI1QuZK3Hq9d7sQ428ZOc\nTmHiyORT6dNG0gT4+bibwS+JQsunlt/NexHmnlD8cXFlNfpOR0l3MBD/Fu57dHZ9\n8SGE9rj9AtpNqrAvi6rgXJuJiNmzZfEqy+Otm+OFcdGUl32H0eFEj/IlNi5ZgoqE\npczaqkbHYwAp24n64CQRPn9uC7M0NL5ptDjDsBbWIaSmbWMlhPN/XuxM8w+It008\n8mD3LOl84VgmpIdfk6OV\n=rsT/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 6ee08bd5741a275a3b82f422a1e45619e4b3943e\nparent 47f6057370226f869799a490095666a8eaff4f5e\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1782253311 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782253311 -0400\n\nfix(code): keep auth modal interactive after install-on-select (#4187)\n\nFixed an unresponsive API-key prompt after installing a provider from\nthe `/model` switcher.\n\n---\n\nWhen the `/model` switcher installs a missing provider extra (e.g.\n`baseten`) and then prompts for an API key, the `AuthPromptScreen` was\ncompletely unresponsive — typing, `F2`, and clicks did nothing.\n\nThe router `_handle_model_selection` scheduled\n`_install_extra_then_switch` via `call_later`, which runs the coroutine\ninline on the App message pump. That flow awaits the credential modal\nthrough `_push_screen_wait`, so the pump stayed blocked for the modal's\nentire lifetime and no key/mouse events were ever forwarded to it. The\nfix runs the install-then-switch flow in a Worker (a separate task) so\nthe pump stays free, mirroring the existing thread-selector pattern;\n`call_after_refresh` lets the dismissing selector fully unwind before\nthe worker starts.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/abddcdb2-ea10-237c-747c-cb4a1f85d7f4)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-06-23T22:21:52Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/afbc56a1d9dbe8a89015f4c2f90bb87547d5c1d4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/afbc56a1d9dbe8a89015f4c2f90bb87547d5c1d4","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/afbc56a1d9dbe8a89015f4c2f90bb87547d5c1d4/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371