e-commit check.","tree":{"sha":"f3256e25dc7252394e529e43c5509ca02b8198a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/f3256e25dc7252394e529e43c5509ca02b8198a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/31a2dc2db0f1585be6fd74e6fc2822b5dae5bc9a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOp/SCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzKMQAAd16+uhNPsIB3yJX34/IhqV\n40BcQzhDe7Z7hA31QrbihMNW9V89q/6iwuGmBPwoiIzbIXXLtJ+eSJaerKABvaBk\nyDEN8BIqjnX+lAgaUh7tfzl09RFFC5UZUo9HsoFCBb2OTYqLdKx+j7VTGIGB30RX\nNKHaQa5gMwQocm5yyCWqsk/uA7JTZ3J7s9OAQ0ztALBcLWRAjwqZwd7q55OWm+dF\n0hm7SQholiiMbbyWzQ8XOTO0LjQ8CjzY4qcYPnzjUT6kj72Bsu9YfHChiSYokxnm\nkJiHf0+GGF3CeR3x4J+nRUw5lXZPY9aFfeSnGzmqXEmBWGPO5E+dCh1VbLRorjLy\nlo02Gea06hYS+v067jE4FDs2ixfWI60FeclUrReNEXESTIgPH33mYr2gbFHwybOd\nG5K5cE9e9KCD2qB+BJG09RRP416LO5B0jsBun80PlaD1jYK1j8c4N0syLf4DBJt9\n8yjCBtfWTcMfBjUINDIgoX/wF3hEf+0oxV1kKuFHwcQC+Ril6wNK69fOTU9xlnBf\nTX7zgPA1fx4xOilNp3PBxz5PIPpExAKQeCaCdY9ZuM6Wa6Xgi6WUpvcTrbqu3JQy\n8+EiaS8aFGh8jXrgqlcJw/Soxte09qXoWWBQkFpVcZSudo1vXqmaLidryd6Jl14G\n/ESkyJhQvihGWL+CrFEP\n=WEp8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f3256e25dc7252394e529e43c5509ca02b8198a2\nparent 717961c5e3458ece3ac569b289bbf4bb787986e7\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1782226898 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782226898 -0400\n\nchore(infra): refine release contributor logging (#4170)\n\nThe release workflow currently prints empty contributor and maintainer\nlines when no matching users are found, which adds noise to release job\nlogs.\n\nThis only prints the community contributor and internal maintainer\nsummaries when those lists are non-empty, and includes the releaser when\nthe workflow resolved one.\n\nValidated by the workflow YAML pre-commit check.","verified_at":"2026-06-23T15:01:38Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/31a2dc2db0f1585be6fd74e6fc282